{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26949","headline":"和太仆田卿酬殷尧藩侍御见寄 · 姚合","name":"和太仆田卿酬殷尧藩侍御见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往还知分熟，酬赠思同新。\n嗜饮殷偏逸，闲吟卿亦贫。\n古苔寒更翠，修竹静无邻。\n促席灯浮酒，听鸿霜满身。\n浅才唯是我，高论更何人。\n携手宜相访，穷行少路尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}